### Kass UI strings, section "appLocation" (converted from i18next).

app-location-title = Move Kass to Applications
app-location-description = Kass is running from { $path }. macOS only keeps microphone, Accessibility and Input Monitoring permissions working for an app in your Applications folder, so dictation may not work from here.
app-location-replaces = The Kass already in Applications will be moved to the Trash.
app-location-move = Move and relaunch
app-location-moving = Moving…
app-location-later = Not now
app-location-manual = Drag Kass into your Applications folder in Finder, then open it from there.
